Red Nose Day Actually is a 2017 British romantic comedy television short promotional film, following a dozen of the
characters from Richard Curtis' Christmas film Love Actually, as part of the fundraising event Red Nose Day 2017.

11
00:10:18,750 --> 00:10:24,750
Curtis returns with many of the cast members from the original film including Hugh Grant, Liam Neeson, Colin Firth, Andrew Lincoln, Chiwetel Ejiofor,
Keira Knightley, Martine McCutcheon, Bill Nighy, Thomas Sangster, Lúcia Moniz, Olivia Olson, Marcus Brigstocke, and Rowan Atkinson.

12
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:21,000
The short film was first broadcast on BBC One on 24
March 2017, as a part of Red Nose Day.

13
00:12:11,250 --> 00:12:17,250
